_service_docs_mappings_modelo_de_datos_mappeos_nuevos_json_modelo_datos__1_attachments_dual_lists", "label": "infoAttachments / resolutionAttachments vs single Jira attachment list", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "bkt-integration-service/docs/mappings/modelo_de_datos_mappeos_nuevos/json_modelo_datos _1.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Splitting requires either a per-attachment flag/label over the native list or two own fields with attachment as aggregate."}, {"id": "bkt_integration_service_docs_mappings_modelo_de_datos_mappeos_nuevos_json_modelo_datos__1_resolution_commitment_sla", "label": "resolutionCommitmentAt: JSM SLA Time to resolution vs duedate", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "bkt-integration-service/docs/mappings/modelo_de_datos_mappeos_nuevos/json_modelo_datos _1.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "JSM SLA covers the calculation; duedate is the alternative but stores only a date without time."}, {"id": "bkt_integration_service_docs_mappings_modelo_de_datos_mappeos_nuevos_json_modelo_datos__1_company_vs_organizations", "label": "company vs JSM organizations", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "bkt-integration-service/docs/mappings/modelo_de_datos_mappeos_nuevos/json_modelo_datos _1.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "JSM organizations is a customer/CSAT concept, not internal structure; fit must be assessed."}, {"id": "bkt_integration_service_docs_mappings_modelo_de_datos_mappeos_nuevos_json_modelo_datos__1_affected_application_components", "label": "affectedApplication vs Jira components", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "bkt-integration-service/docs/mappings/modelo_de_datos_mappeos_nuevos/json_modelo_datos _1.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "cap